{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30364","headline":"今年新先辈以遏密之际每有讌集必资清谈书此奉贺 · 赵嘏","name":"今年新先辈以遏密之际每有讌集必资清谈书此奉贺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天上高高月桂丛，分明三十一枝风。\n满怀春色向人动，遮路乱花迎马红。\n鹤驭回飘云雨外，兰亭不在管弦中。\n居然自是前贤事，何必青楼倚翠空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}